      en: ["Obosnik is the absolute highest point on the Luštica Peninsula.", "The summit offers the clearest vantage point of the Croatian Prevlaka Peninsula.", "The transmission tower on the peak is a critical hub for Montenegrin broadcasting.", "A narrow, winding paved road reaches almost to the very top of the mountain.", "Remains of old Austrian military barracks can still be found near the peak.", "The mountain serves as a major navigational landmark for sailors in the Adriatic."],
