      en: ["Founded in the 13th century on the Gračanica River", "Dedicated to St. Luke the Apostle and Evangelist", "Repeatedly destroyed by Ottomans (1852, 1877)", "Rebuilt in 1881 by Prince Nikola I", "Houses precious relics of local saints", "Famous for hand-embroidered works by the nuns"],
