      en: ["Built in the 15th century (Venetian era).", "Located at an altitude of 230 meters above sea level.", "Features a unique church with two altars (Orthodox/Catholic).", "Captured and occupied by the Ottomans in 1571.", "Served as a military garrison until the year 1877.", "Provides a 360-degree view of Sutomore and the sea."],
